      <template v-if="modal === 'reports'"><div class="report-intro"><FileDown :size="20" /><div><strong>任务档案</strong><p>已保存 {{ reports.length }} 份报告，保留最近 5 次任务。</p></div></div><div v-if="!reports.length" class="empty-state"><FileDown :size="34" /><strong>暂无巡检报告</strong><p>开始巡检后，点击“生成报告”保存本次任务记录。</p></div><article v-for="report in reports" :key="report.id" class="report-card"><span class="report-icon"><FileDown :size="21" /></span><div><strong>{{ report.routeName }}</strong><p>{{ report.createdAt }}</p><small>{{ time(report.elapsed) }} <i>·</i> {{ report.distance.toFixed(1) }} m <i>·</i> {{ statusLabels[report.status] || report.status }}</small></div><div class="report-actions"><button @click="download(report, 'html')">导出报告</button><button @click="download(report, 'json')">导出数据</button></div></article></template>
    </section></div>
